    <briefdescription>
<para>Caches a NeoN::la::Solver instance for a given field to avoid reconstructing it (and re-parsing the solver dictionary) on every time-step iteration. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Usage: <programlisting><codeline><highlight class="keyword">auto</highlight><highlight class="normal"><sp/>uSolver<sp/>=<sp/>nf::Solver(U,<sp/>rt);<sp/><sp/><sp/></highlight><highlight class="comment">//<sp/>once<sp/>before<sp/>the<sp/>time<sp/>loop</highlight><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight><highlight class="comment">//<sp/>inside<sp/>the<sp/>loop:</highlight><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">nf::PDE&lt;NeoN::Vec3&gt;<sp/>UEqn(dsl::imp::ddt(U)<sp/>+<sp/>...);</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">uSolver.solve(UEqn,<sp/>-1.0<sp/>*<sp/>dsl::exp::grad(p));<sp/><sp/><sp/></highlight><highlight class="comment">//<sp/>momentum<sp/>predictor</highlight><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">uSolver.assemble(UEqn);<sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/></highlight><highlight class="comment">//<sp/>or<sp/>explicit<sp/>assembly<sp/>only</highlight></codeline>
</programlisting> </para>
    </detaileddescription>
